{
  "version": 14,
  "min_helper": "2026.10.14.2",
  "_": [
    "The quota adapters behind the CPA rung — see adapter.go for the vocabulary.",
    "Protocol per the CLI Proxy API Management Center's quota page at the commit",
    "pinned in types.go (cpamcReferenceCommit): the same vendor endpoints, the",
    "same headers, read here by table rather than by code. Every host below",
    "must be on the allow-list in cpa.go; the table cannot widen it.",
    "$TOKEN$ is substituted by CLI Proxy API, never by this helper.",
    "`credential` is the local rung (local.go): where the vendor's own tool leaves its token on a machine without a proxy.",
    "v4 (2026.10.07.2, CPAMC 6abace9f): `credits`, `resets` (reset credits: how many are held, when each lapses)",
    "and `renews` (a plan's renewal date, only ever one still ahead); `used_fraction` windows; placeholders in",
    "request URLs (query values, escaped). min_helper keeps older helpers on the table they have — and the two",
    "hosts this version adds (api.kimi.ai, server.codeium.com) are off their allow-lists, which refuses it there too.",
    "Claude's usage is asked with ?cedar_ember=1 and the claude-cli User-Agent: that is what returns the reset grants.",
    "v5 (2026.10.07.3): reset credits say what can be done with them now — `usable` (Codex's applicable count),",
    "`eligible` / `item_usable` / `item_needs_limit` / `at_limit` (Claude's grants: usable, not paused, and at a",
    "limit when the grant asks for one), `wait_until` (a cooldown) and `item_clears` + `clears_map` (which windows a",
    "grant clears, by length).",
    "v6 (2026.10.07.4): `limited` — whether the vendor says the account is at its limit now, any one flag stated:",
    "Codex's rate_limit.limit_reached or allowed:false (the account's own limit, not an additional model's), Claude's",
    "cedar_ember.at_limit.",
    "v7 (2026.10.07.6): the plan's date says what it is — `renews` where the vendor says the plan renews then, `ends`",
    "where it says it ends then (Codex: an entitlement's expires_at `unless` it names a renewal at all), `until` where",
    "it says only how long the period runs (Codex's credential claim, Devin's planEnd); the first that lands is the one.",
    "v8 (2026.10.07.7): a window's amounts can take their unit from the vendor's own field — `unit_from` + `unit_map`;",
    "a value the map does not name keeps the share and drops the amounts. Claude's extra usage: currency USD is usd, and",
    "an account billed in another currency shows its share alone rather than dollars it was never charged.",
    "v9 (2026.10.07.7, CodexBar 6710f07e): Claude's `iguana_necktie` is a dollar-denominated cloud credit, not a weekly window;",
    "reset grants take `starts` (a grant not yet begun is not held; paused and ineligible ones are held, not usable —",
    "v5's rule — and `gate` / `when` exist for a vendor whose list is void without a flag); `renews` takes `when` (Codex's",
    "active_until is a renewal only while will_renew is true); Codex's monthly individual_limit; Kimi's ratio pools and",
    "membership plan; Grok's on-demand ratio and billingPeriodEnd; Antigravity's summary shapes (response/summary wrappers,",
    "nested remaining, explicit window, disabled). Keys a helper does not know are ignored.",
    "v10 (2026.10.14.1): `credential.keychain` — macOS: the generic-password service the vendor's tool keeps the same",
    "document under (Claude Code: `Claude Code-credentials`), read when none of the `files` exists.",
    "v11 (2026.10.14.2): Antigravity's local rung — agy's own token file (~/.gemini/antigravity-cli/antigravity-oauth-token,",
    "written on Linux and wherever the OS keyring is unavailable; on macOS the keychain item is encrypted and unreadable),",
    "and a quota request per channel: the proxy's carries the project its credential names, the local one none — Google",
    "answers retrieveUserQuotaSummary without it (verified 2026-10-14), and agy's file holds no project id.",
    "v12 (the helper after 2026.10.18.5, CodexBar 3386b0ad): `merge: max` on a window — a later row for a key already read",
    "stands when it says more is used. Kimi's ratio pools beside its counters: two readings of one period that disagree,",
    "and the more exhausted is the one believed (before: the counter, always). A helper before this key drops the later",
    "row as it always did.",
    "v13 (2026.10.14.2 keeps reading it, CPAMC 390718ec): Grok's client version is 1.0.46. cli-chat-proxy.grok.com refuses an",
    "x-grok-client-version under 1.0.13 with 426 (CLIProxyAPI #6249, since 2026-10-01), so the 0.2.91 the table named left Grok's",
    "CPA and local rungs without any window; the user-agent names the same version twice. No new key, no new host.",
    "v14 (2026.10.14.2 keeps reading it, CPAMC 714de076, CodexBar 8928b6ee): Antigravity speaks as the Hub, antigravity/hub/2.23.0",
    "darwin/arm64 — Cloud Code withholds newer models from clients under 2.23.0 (CPAMC 91b47855bf, CLIProxyAPI's floor). Claude's",
    "usage asks Accept: application/json (CPAMC b41c23890c). Antigravity's plan: standard-tier is Paid, and `unless_window` (the",
    "helper after 2026.10.18.5) drops a Free that a measured 5h window contradicts — Cloud Code can say free-tier for a paid",
    "account, and five-hour quota is paid-only (CodexBar f50cd6cee4); a helper before the key shows the Free it always did. No new host."
  ],
  "vendors": {
    "claude": {
      "provider": "claude",
      "name": "Claude Code",
      "requests": [
        {
          "id": "usage",
          "method": "GET",
          "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/api/oauth/usage?cedar_ember=1",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": "Bearer $TOKEN$",
            "Content-Type": "application/json",
            "Accept": "application/json",
            "User-Agent": "claude-cli/2.1.280 (external, cli)"
          },
          "headers_cpa": {
            "anthropic-beta": "oauth-2025-04-20"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "profile",
          "method": "GET",
          "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/api/oauth/profile",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": "Bearer $TOKEN$",
            "Content-Type": "application/json",
            "User-Agent": "claude-cli/2.1.280 (external, cli)"
          },
          "optional": true,
          "headers_cpa": {
            "anthropic-beta": "oauth-2025-04-20"
          },
          "channel": "cpa"
        }
      ],
      "windows": [
        {
          "from": "usage",
          "each": "limits[]",
          "key": "{kind}",
          "key_map": {
            "session": "session",
            "weekly_all": "weekly",
            "weekly": "weekly",
            "weekly_scoped": "weekly_scoped"
          },
          "label": "{kind}",
          "label_map": {
            "session": "5h",
            "weekly_all": "7d",
            "weekly": "7d",
            "weekly_scoped": "7d"
          },
          "used": "percent",
          "resets": "resets_at",
          "active": "is_active",
          "severity": "severity",
          "scope": "{scope.model.display_name}"
        },
        {
          "from": "usage",
          "base": "five_hour",
          "key": "session",
          "label": "5h",
          "used": "utilization",
          "resets": "resets_at",
          "skip_if_any": [
            "session"
          ]
        },
        {
          "from": "usage",
          "base": "seven_day",
          "key": "weekly",
          "label": "7d",
          "used": "utilization",
          "resets": "resets_at",
          "skip_if_any": [
            "weekly"
          ]
        },
        {
          "from": "usage",
          "base": "seven_day_opus",
          "key": "weekly_scoped",
          "label": "7d",
          "scope": "Opus",
          "used": "utilization",
          "resets": "resets_at",
          "skip_if_any": [
            "weekly_scoped"
          ]
        },
        {
          "from": "usage",
          "base": "seven_day_sonnet",
          "key": "weekly_scoped",
          "label": "7d",
          "scope": "Sonnet",
          "used": "utilization",
          "resets": "resets_at",
          "skip_if_any": [
            "weekly_scoped"
          ]
        },
        {
          "from": "usage",
          "base": "iguana_necktie",
          "key": "cloud_credits",
          "label": "cloud",
          "used_kind": "ratio",
          "used": "used_dollars",
          "limit": "limit_dollars",
          "remaining": "remaining_dollars",
          "unit": "usd",
          "resets": "resets_at"
        },
        {
          "from": "usage",
          "base": "extra_usage",
          "when": {
            "path": "is_enabled",
            "eq": "true"
          },
          "key": "extra",
          "label": "extra",
          "used_kind": "ratio",
          "used": "used_credits",
          "limit": "monthly_limit",
          "amount_scale": 0.01,
          "unit": "usd",
          "unit_from": "currency",
          "unit_map": {
            "USD": "usd"
          }
        }
      ],
      "plan": {
        "from": "profile",
        "any_of": [
          {
            "path": "account.has_claude_max",
            "eq": "true",
            "value": "Max"
          },
          {
            "path": "account.has_claude_pro",
            "eq": "true",
            "value": "Pro"
          },
          {
            "path": "organization.organization_type",
            "eq": "claude_team",
            "value": "Team"
          },
          {
            "path": "organization.organization_type",
            "eq": "claude_enterprise",
            "value": "Enterprise"
          }
        ]
      },
      "tier": {
        "from": "profile",
        "path": "organization.rate_limit_tier",
        "map": {
          "default_claude_max_5x": "5x",
          "default_claude_max_20x": "20x",
          "default_claude_pro": "1x"
        }
      },
      "credential": {
        "files": [
          "$CLAUDE_SECURESTORAGE_CONFIG_DIR/.credentials.json",
          "$CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR/.credentials.json",
          "~/.claude/.credentials.json"
        ],
        "keychain": "Claude Code-credentials",
        "token": "claudeAiOauth.accessToken",
        "expires": "claudeAiOauth.expiresAt",
        "expires_format": "epoch_ms",
        "plan": {
          "from": "cred",
          "path": "claudeAiOauth.subscriptionType",
          "map": {
            "max": "Max",
            "pro": "Pro",
            "team": "Team",
            "enterprise": "Enterprise",
            "free": "Free"
          }
        },
        "tier": {
          "from": "cred",
          "path": "claudeAiOauth.rateLimitTier",
          "map": {
            "default_claude_max_5x": "5x",
            "default_claude_max_20x": "20x",
            "default_claude_pro": "1x"
          }
        },
        "signin": "claude"
      },
      "resets": [
        {
          "from": "usage",
          "base": "cedar_ember",
          "each": "grants[]",
          "item_left": "resets_left",
          "item_total": "resets_total",
          "starts": "starts_at",
          "expires": "ends_at",
          "eligible": {
            "path": "eligible",
            "ne": "false"
          },
          "item_usable": [
            {
              "path": "usable_now",
              "ne": "false"
            },
            {
              "path": "paused",
              "ne": "true"
            }
          ],
          "item_needs_limit": {
            "path": "use_requires_limit",
            "eq": "true"
          },
          "at_limit": {
            "path": "at_limit",
            "eq": "true"
          },
          "wait_until": "cooldown_until",
          "item_clears": "clears",
          "clears_map": {
            "five_hour": "5h",
            "seven_day": "7d",
            "seven_day_overage_included": "7d"
          }
        }
      ],
      "limited": [
        {
          "from": "usage",
          "path": "cedar_ember.at_limit",
          "eq": "true"
        }
      ]
    },
    "codex": {
      "provider": "codex",
      "name": "Codex",
